            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Carpet 3.3.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fixed:</strong> the footer on a saved text note (source + time) could occasionally render upside-down in the library. Notes now display as lightweight text and only load the full editor when you click to edit — so the layout can't flip, and there are fewer heavy editors in memory.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
