            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>A bigger, Spotlight-style search</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Larger search bar.</b> "Ask your Memory" is now a big, Spotlight-sized field — easier to read and faster to type into.</li>
  <li><b>Bigger Open App button.</b> The notch's Open App shortcut is larger and easier to hit.</li>
  <li><b>Smaller fake notch on external monitors.</b> On displays without a real notch, the simulated notch is more compact and sits flush in the menu bar.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
